  _globals['_TRIGGERDELIVERYATTEMPT'].fields_by_name['trigger_type']._serialized_options = b'\222A\377\0012\311\001Why this attempt was made: TRIGGER_DELIVERY_ATTEMPT_TRIGGER_TYPE_SCHEDULED for the first attempt or an automatic retry, TRIGGER_DELIVERY_ATTEMPT_TRIGGER_TYPE_MANUAL for a retry someone started by hand.J1\"TRIGGER_DELIVERY_ATTEMPT_TRIGGER_TYPE_SCHEDULED\"'
